@startuml Review Lifecycle
skinparam stateFontSize 14

[*] --> current : user creates review\nfor aspect (comparator/validator)

current --> superseded : new review created\nfor same record + aspect
current --> outdated : underlying data changes\n(reprocess, sync, new\ncomparison/validation results)

superseded --> [*]
outdated --> [*]

note right of current
  Active review visible
  in carousel view
end note

note right of outdated
  Shown with warning indicator.
  Triggered by:
  - outdate_current(record_id, aspect_name)
  - Called when task changes
    comparison/validation results
end note

note right of superseded
  Historical record.
  Replaced by newer review.
end note
@enduml
